EIN. MEER. VON. SAND.
      -=[ a demo for MS-DOS - 2026 ]=-

 the sand drift monument at Tisvilde, 1738,
 read letter by letter in German, Danish
 and English: each letter a partial of A2.

 VGA 320x200 - Sound Blaster 16 - 386+
 8:54 - runs in DOSBox (RUN.BAT)
 concept & direction: Kasper Bergholt
 code: APL & Pascal (AI-assisted)